  "coverage_roots": [
    "config",
    "tools/guard"
  ],
  "kind": "configuration_loader_binding",
  "rule": "R4",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "statement": "Schema before data. When a configuration format is extended, the accepting reader or validator is effective first, at the latest in the same commit. No configuration file may carry a field its declared loader does not yet accept. Every configuration file below a coverage root is bound to exactly one reader, and every gate loads it with that reader; a failure fails the block."
}
